   "he": "וְלֹא יָרַד טַל לִבְרָכָה וְנִיטַּל טַעַם פֵּירוֹת וְכוּ׳. תַּנְיָא, רַבִּי שִׁמְעוֹן בֶּן אֶלְעָזָר אוֹמֵר: טׇהֳרָה — בִּטְּלָה טַעַם וָרֵיחַ, מַעֲשֵׂר — בִּיטֵּל שׁוֹמֶן דָּגָן.",
   "en": "§ The mishna taught that since the destruction of the Temple, «dew has not descended for a blessing, and the taste has been removed from fruit. It is taught» in a baraita: «Rabbi Shimon ben Elazar says:» The lost «purity has removed the taste and the aroma;» the «tithes» that were not separated «have removed the fat of grain.»"
  }
